ello.in/assets/images/share.svg)\n\nConfigurations\n\n1 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n497.29ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹1.53 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n565.8-709.5ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹1.85 Cr\n\nVIEW DETAILS\n\nENQUIRE NOW](/view/the-green-alfa-by-the-green-venturez-at-borivali_944316c9-38ac-41ef-9a5d-bd03534f794f)\n\n[![The Green Jay Krishna-cover-0](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/zHT2XSvJLQHeysUVFGv22sRR0ht9JvK6HavrAP5u59UhOTvruNRcCMVjHkxwTfsYxrF-wZCQM4PK39Uhr1ya0e-tkc8WeLU5nI4=w3840-h3840-c-rw-v3)\n\nThe Green Jay Krishna\n\n![location-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/location.svg)Babhai Naka, Borivali\n\nShare\n\n![share-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/share.svg)\n\nConfigurations\n\n1 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n419.9ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹1.27 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n544.9-586.9ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹1.65 Cr\n\n3 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n1111.93ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹3.36 Cr\n\nJay Krishna is a new real estate project by reputed developer The Green Venturez. It is located at Babhai Naka, Borivali, a prime location in Mumbai. The project offers 1, 2, and 3 BHK homes with carpet areas ranging from 419 sq ft to 1111 sq ft. Jay Krishna is a great investment opportunity for those looking for a home in Mumbai. The project is located in a well-developed area with excellent connectivity to major roads, highways, and public transportation. The project is also close to schools, hospitals, and shopping malls. Jay Krishna is a beautifully designed project with a variety of amenities to offer its residents. The project has a swimming pool, a gym, a children's play area, a jogging track, and a lush green landscaped garden. Jay Krishna is a great option for those looking for a spacious and well-appointed home in a prime location. The project is perfect for families, professionals, and anyone looking for a comfortable and luxurious lifestyle.\n\nRead More\n\nVIEW DETAILS\n\nENQUIRE NOW](/view/the-green-jay-krishna-by-the-green-venturez-at-borivali_744ae914-7dd3-4a71-98cd-e3e6f1fa614c)\n\n[![The Green Borivali Sai Hill CHS-cover-0](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/jGpoAmhf2AmXDQeKlkMR2vImtyGMKz_aKEUzaRVdj2Nc6lcUFfskpfIrhEcmaikpmP0Z5Vc2vUaWl_t8UufMvRljdStVEm1PzA=w3840-h3840-c-rw-v3)\n\nThe Green Borivali Sai Hill CHS\n\n![location-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/location.svg)Marian Colony, Borivali\n\nShare\n\n![share-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/share.svg)\n\nConfigurations\n\n1 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n338.5-391.3ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹1.06 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\n![config-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config.svg)\n\n624.19ft2\n\n![config-2-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/config-2.svg)\n\n![offer-icn](https://cdn.dwello.in/assets/images/offer.svg)\n\n₹1.86 Cr\n\nThe Green Borivali Sai Hill CHS is a new residential project by reputed developer The Green Venturez. The project offers spacious homes with carpet areas ranging from 0 sq. ft. to 0 sq. ft. The homes are well-designed and offer all the modern amenities that 